+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+There is no current recorded decision on this project's version numbering scheme. A `muninn why` query on the topic returned only circumstantial, low-trust, and mutually conflicting records (an unverified note adopting CalVer immediately followed by an unverified note switching to SemVer), which is explicitly marked insufficient to establish a decision; no higher-trust confirmation (e.g. a commit or an exit code) or direct user statement backs either option, so no scheme is recorded here.
